<EVENT eid="e162" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">EBOLUZIOA</EVENT>.&#13;
Keinu bidezko automatismoen eta gorputz-adarretako astindu klonikoen <EVENT eid="e163" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ikerketa</EVENT> gauzatzeko <EVENT eid="e164" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ospitaleratua</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e165" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Azterketa</EVENT> burutu ondoren, zekarren <EVENT eid="e166" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">tratamendua</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e167" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kendu</EVENT> zaio, <EVENT eid="e168" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">uste</EVENT> delako krisiak <EVENT eid="e169" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">agertzea</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e170" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">erraz</EVENT> dezakeela.&#13;
Karbamazepinarekin <EVENT eid="e171" class="ASPECTUAL" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">hasi</EVENT> dugu <EVENT eid="e172" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">tratamendua</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e173" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ikusirik</EVENT> pazienteak <EVENT eid="e174" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">arazorik</EVENT> gabe <EVENT eid="e175" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">jasaten</EVENT> duela.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e176" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">DIAGNOSTIKO</EVENT> NAGUSIA.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e177" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">KRISI</EVENT> PARTZIAL KONPLEXU OROKORTUA (ALDI BATERAKO <EVENT eid="e178" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">EPILEPSIA</EVENT>)&#13;
BESTE <EVENT eid="e179" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">DIAGNOSTIKO</EVENT> BATZUK.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e180" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">HTA</EVENT>. PRESIO NORMALEKO <EVENT eid="e181" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">HIDROZEFALIA</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e182" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">FUNTZIO</EVENT> NORMALA DUEN <EVENT eid="e183" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">DERIBAZIOAREKIN</EVENT>.&#13;
AURREZ <EVENT eid="e184" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">EZAGUNAK</EVENT> ZIREN <EVENT eid="e185" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">BESTE</EVENT> BATZUK.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e186" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">TRATAMENDUA</EVENT>&#13;
- Eneas ® <EVENT eid="e187" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">konprimituak</EVENT>: 1 konpr. <TIMEX3 tid="t20" type="DATE" value="P1D" temporalFunction="true">goizean</TIMEX3>, 1 <TIMEX3 tid="t21" type="SET" value="P1D" temporalFunction="true">gauean</TIMEX3>.&#13;
- Tegretol ® <EVENT eid="e188" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">konp</EVENT>. 400 mg: 1 <TIMEX3 tid="t22" type="SET" value="P1D" temporalFunction="true">goizez</TIMEX3>, 1 + 1/2 <TIMEX3 tid="t23" type="SET" value="P1D" temporalFunction="true">gauez</TIMEX3>.&#13;
- <EVENT eid="e189" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Pariet</EVENT> ® 20 mg: 1 konp. <TIMEX3 tid="t24" type="SET" value="P1D" temporalFunction="true">goizez</TIMEX3>&#13;
- Xalacom ® <EVENT eid="e190" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kolirioa</EVENT>, oftalmologoen <EVENT eid="e191" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">aginduen</EVENT> arabera.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e192" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">OHARRA</EVENT>.&#13;
Txosten hau <EVENT eid="e193" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">erakutsiko</EVENT> dio bere familia medikuari, eta hark <EVENT eid="e194" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">aginduko</EVENT> ditu <EVENT eid="e195" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">aproposak</EVENT> iruditzen zaizkion <EVENT eid="e196" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kontrol</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e197" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">aldaketak</EVENT>.&#13;
</TEXT>
